# Output Format

## 1. Macro Dashboard

| Category          | Metric                    | Value       | Signal      |
|-------------------|---------------------------|-------------|-------------|
| Growth            | Real GDP YoY              | 2.5%        | Moderate    |
| Growth            | GDP QoQ (SAAR)            | 2.1%        | Slowing     |
| Inflation         | Core PCE YoY              | 2.9%        | Above target|
| Inflation         | Breakeven 10Y             | 2.4%        | Anchored    |
| Labor             | Unemployment              | 3.9%        | Low         |
| Labor             | NFP Monthly               | 175K        | Healthy     |
| Policy            | Fed Funds Rate            | 5.25-5.50%  | Restrictive |
| Yield Curve       | 10Y - 2Y Spread           | -30bps      | Inverted    |
| Sentiment         | ISM Manufacturing         | 49.5        | Contraction |
| Sentiment         | Consumer Confidence       | 98.0        | Neutral     |

## 2. Taylor Rule Analysis

| Component              | Value       |
|------------------------|-------------|
| Neutral Real Rate (r*) | 1.0%        |
| Current Inflation (π)  | 2.9%        |
| Inflation Gap (π - π*) | +0.9%       |
| Output Gap (y - y*)    | +0.5%       |
| Taylor-Implied Rate    | 4.60%       |
| Actual Fed Funds Rate  | 5.38%       |
| **Gap (Actual - Taylor)** | **+78bps (restrictive)** |

Calculation:
i* = 1.0% + 2.9% + 0.5(0.9%) + 0.5(0.5%)
i* = 1.0% + 2.9% + 0.45% + 0.25%
i* = 4.60%

